Count_B3:: I'm sure I must be imagining it, but I must ask - have you been avoiding me?
    Player:: Yes. When we first met you stood there and counted down for 20 seconds. Twice.
        Count_B3:: Well I AM a Count. That's part of the job.
            Player:: I think the counting is from your other job, not your title.
    Player:: No I love counting. I am 5 years old.
        Count_B3:: I'm sorry, I think I just get nervous and lean to hard into the whole counting schtick.
            Count_B3:: Even though I've been to hundreds of these balls, I still get nervous.
                Count_B3:: The whole puppet situation doesn't help either - I've almost never seen a fellow felted.
                    Player:: So you've got felt skin, and there's just a guy's arm inside you? Piloting things? Who even is he? What's his deal?
                        Count_B3:: Guiseppe? He's my manservant. Same as any other count.
                    Player:: Yeah. I know what you mean. Or something similar at least.